  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Support to the Government of Sweden for the Resettlement and Family Reunification Beneficiaries of International Protection with Their Family Members (2023-24)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to providing a durable solution to ca. 900 beneficiaries of international protection in various countries worldwide by facilitating their resettlement to Sweden, as well as contribute to family unity for ca. 133 family members of beneficiaries of international protection residing in Sweden by facilitating their family reunification to Sweden. The project will run from April 2023 to March 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
